   "type": "heading",
   "text": "WHAT WE FOUND"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Across the six areas, 13% of street users were on micro- mobility (72 of 556). Areas 01 and 04 recorded none, and they hold 61% of all pedestrians. Area 02 reaches 23%."
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "The pressure sits in one place. In Area 03 micro-mobility users outnumber pedestrians: 47 of them, more than half of everyone on the street. Elsewhere walking and vehicles barely meet."
